---
description: Run Reaper after tests for semantic regression protection
alwaysApply: true
---

Integration version 1. After editing code, run repository tests and static
checks, then `reaper check --format agent --task "the user's requested change"`.
Fix blocking findings and applicable warnings; rerun tests and Reaper.
Investigate exit 2 or `complete: false`. Never weaken rules to pass, broaden the
task to justify unrelated edits, or write API keys to source files.
